WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.709
Wassup ballas? Got somethin’
special fo yo asses today. Not only am I about

00:00:12.709 --> 00:00:17.040
to drop some mad knowledge on da illest chapter
in The Brothers Karamazov,

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.980
but I’m a show you how you can check some
similar philosophizin’ in The Dark Knight.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.670
So here’s my special on The Grand Inquisitor.
It’s a ridiculous thing, but I want

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:26.730
to tell it to you.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.820
Now The Grand Inquisitor is a poem

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:36.850
dat Ivan lays on his bro Alyosha while they conversatin bout God and mankind.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:40.220
Lemme break it down for ya.
Back during the Spanish Inquisition,

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:45.720
homies gettin BLAZED left and
right for not keepin it Catholic... but not in a good way.

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:51.360
In short, sh** is fu**ed up.
Then outta nowhere JESUS HIMSELF swings into

00:00:51.369 --> 00:00:54.220
town and starts healing the sick like a
boss.

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:59.080
When the top dawg in charge, the
Grand Inquisitor, sees this holy-sh** goin down,

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:05.280
he says “AW HELL NAW JESUS” and
throws his ass behind bars. Then he say “Look, JC,

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:10.360
why’d you gotta go and give mankind
the freedom to choose between good and evil?

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:16.180
What, you think humans be noble enough to make
this choice themselves? NAW BLOOD.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:21.580
With that freedom, they ALWAYS gonna choose evil. Man
needs someone to MAKE him do good.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:26.340
The worst thing you ever did was not force them to bow down to you. And that’s what I do.

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:32.240
I save them from themselves by jackin' their freedom
and makin' em bow down to me.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:42.300
This poem bringin' up all sorts of
questions for us to marinate on.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:46.040
Like how human beings gonna act when they 
ain’t got no laws holdin' them down?

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:06.540
Not only is the Inquisitor spittin'
this to ol' JC, but this is exactly tha kind

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:10.200
of truth dat the Joker layin on 
Batman in The Dark Knight.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:21.220
See, their morals, their code... it’s a bad joke, dropped at the first sign of trouble.

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:24.540
They’re only as good as the
world allows them to be.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:32.800
I'll show you –&nbsp;when the chips are down, these civilized people... they’ll eat each other.”

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:36.740
And the Joker ain’t all talk. Erry
one of his terrorist acts goes to prove

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:41.960
the Inquisitor’s raw truth: at it’s core,
man is a viscious fu**in animal,

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:45.620
and, when the sh** goes down, that beastly side comes
out.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:53.400
"If Coleman Reese isn't dead in 60 minutes, then I blow up a hospital.”

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:56.600
"Commissioner, do you really think an ordinary citizen would try to kill this man?"

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:57.900
"Commissioner!"

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:03.340
But luckily there’s hope for the homies
of G-Town. In the face of all this chaotic mess,

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:07.740
there’s one brutha who thuggin righteous enough to inspire people to do good:

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:10.840
Harvey Dent, Gotham’s White
Knight.

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:14.540
Just like the Inquisitor sayin:
human beings ain’t legit enough to follow

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:20.370
Christ just cuz. Naw. They need dat bread
first. Matter of fact, they’ll even throw

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:23.650
their savior to the curb to get what they
fiendin for.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:39.720
Well the truth hits hard in The Dark Knight. Cuz dem crooked-ass cops in Gordon’s

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:44.980
posse gonna give up their Ideal just so they
can stack dat cheddar.

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:47.900
"What exactly did you think they were gonna do?"

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:50.360
"They got me early on, my mother's hospital bills and.."

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:51.220
"Don't!"

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:55.670
Now ain’t errybody think people dat
bent in da head. At first, Batman reppin da

00:03:55.670 --> 00:04:00.630
big JC by thinkin that if given the opportunity,
mankind gonna choose good.

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:04.320
But after seein what The Joker’s
whack-ass philosophy did to Harey Dent,

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:10.190
ol' Bats ain’t the same no mo. Batman realize
that stoppin the Joker ain’t enough.

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:16.650
He gonna have to step off his Christly grind and get all Inquisitor-style in order to save Gotham's Soul.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:20.820
Like the Inquistor preachin, the
only way to make life bearable for da masses

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:25.560
is to “enslave them by a miracle” and
“give them someone to bow down to.”

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:30.960
So BAM, Batman gotta make up some
bullsh** in order to keep the masses dumb

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:36.569
and happy. So he lies, jivin that Harvey Dent
kept it real til the end and didn’t smoke

00:04:36.569 --> 00:04:42.520
no innocent hustlas. Even though Harvey Dent aint nothin but a fake-ass savior, it don’t matter.

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:48.460
What do matter is that mankind got
an ideal to bow down to to save them from themselves.

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:51.840
And the sacrifice for lying to make
make all dem fools happy?

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:53.840
Somebody's gotta suffer.

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:15.540
On the real, the truth can be so
damn fugly that it’s gotta be kept on the DL

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.140
for the good of the hood.

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:22.000
"'Cause sometimes...truth isn't good enough."

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.000
"Sometimes people deserve more..."

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:29.920
Yo, I hope you enjoyed this episode.
It may not have been the one you needed,

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:35.000
but it’s the one you deserve. And hey, if you
diggin my cinema criticism, let me know.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:42.040
Take it easy, y’all. Peace!

